    {
      "id": "a7308026-25a2-4983-a327-8bad1d9e4758",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 0
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "faf6132f-aee5-42b5-a13a-f1c163733e64",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Log: Roof alarm\nreceived. Station\nreply sent. Shared\nrelay froze",
                "before the reply\nleft. No second\npath existed. The\noperator stayed",
                "to hand carry the\nreply, but the\ngate crew had\nalready withdrawn.",
                "Nobody could\nconfirm whether\nthe message\narrived."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "14f4e64d-2266-4459-af0d-8f8e7195dd09",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "e529a56b-c9e1-407c-a730-00036d7dcbe5",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Dot marks a second\npaper fault: the\ndepot gate is\nblocked while the",
                "relay remains\nfrozen. Courier\nroute A crosses\nthat gate. Foot\nroute",
                "B goes through the\narchive service\nlane and touches\nneither gate nor",
                "relay. Wire route\nC uses the frozen\nrelay. These are\ntest marks",
                "only; no public\ndoorway is locked.\nMoxie asks for a\nbackup that",
                "survives both\nfaults, not just\nthe one that made\nyesterday famous."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "735996a5-e148-4084-a100-92f394214432",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "8cd1523d-3d07-45f8-a5ba-b7277db172aa",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Dot: The wire path\nruns roof, relay,\nstation. A courier\npath can run",
                "station, depot,\nroof. They share\nno relay. A second\nwire through the",
                "same frozen box\nwould have the\nsame fault. A new\ncolor is not a new",
                "path."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "23c6d2b1-61b7-4f03-a6e8-6a6c06dfbc76",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 3
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "7fc21a87-d21d-4a15-af62-a4a4f9066083",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "For the EARLIER\nrelay-only\nfailure, before\nthe gate fault was\nadded,",
                "which backup\navoided the failed\nrelay? The next\ncheck will",
                "separately ask you\nto solve the\ntwo-fault drill.\nKeep the two cases",
                "distinct in the\nlog."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "03a63186-a940-4877-a2cd-2f6c09bbedb3",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 4
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "00439dab-25fb-4ed1-a958-6b16603cc1cd",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "For this two-fault\ndrill, which route\ncan still carry\nthe reply? Use",
                "the map topology\nrather than\nassuming any\ncourier path must\nbe",
                "independent. Moxie\nis willing to walk\nthe longer foot\nroute, but",
                "wants the planner\nto name why it is\nneeded. Dot keeps\nboth blocked",
                "components marked\nso nobody forgets\nthe second\nconstraint while",
                "solving the first."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "38434902-a610-44f6-ae09-0b7dc883da85",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 5
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "d0390629-bf1e-406e-ad7e-dd7a0969d977",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Clerk: I will log\nthe sent message\nand ask for a\nreceived mark. If",
                "no mark returns,\nMoxie carries a\ncopy. We will not\ncall silence",
                "agreement. Pip\nwrites that\nsentence at the\ntop, then asks\npermission",
                "to keep it there."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    }
  ]
